abstract: >-
  Thirty-one benchmark cases for pipe network solvers, each with a cited reference value,
  the value computed by Fluid Network Studio, the deviation and a pre-declared acceptance band.
  Same-family comparisons agree within 0.32% and cross-code comparisons within 2.61%.
